{"product_id":"ready-set-weld","title":"Ready, Set,  Weld!","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelding made effortless! With simple techniques targeted to a wide and general audience, this guide eliminates the intimidation from an all-too-often technical craft. Rather than creating a manual workbook with elaborate, complicated drawings and instructions, Kimberli Matin takes readers on a journey of creative discovery. With purchased steel rod and bar or found metal parts from a salvage yard, plus basic, easy-to-use tools, she shows how to construct 25 whimsically attractive items. From a garden chair fashioned from an old tractor seat and odd parts to a stunning tri-fold screen and a delicate, filigreed plant stand, these great projects will make welders out of everyone! \u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kimberli Matin\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781600592621\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 10 x 260\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750680764569,"sku":"3RF9781600592621","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/ready-set-weld-517965.jpg?v=1694791270","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/ready-set-weld","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}